#: .\templates\about\about.html:13
msgid "About Speedy Net"
msgstr "O Speedy Netu"

#: .\templates\about\about.html:17 .\templates\main\main_page.html:13
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://%(language_code)s.speedy.net/\" title=\"Speedy "
"Net\">Speedy Net</a> is a new social network. With Speedy Net you can "
"communicate with your friends. Speedy Net is open to free registration for "
"people from all countries and ages (no age limit!). The site is vegan and "
"vegetarian friendly. It is currently available in %(languages_num)s "
"languages."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://%(language_code)s.speedy.net/\" title=\"Speedy "
"Net\">Speedy Net</a> je nova društvena mreža. Uz Speedy Net možete "
"komunicirati sa svojim prijateljima. Speedy Net je otvoren za besplatnu "
"registraciju za ljude iz svih zemalja i dobi (bez dobnih ograničenja!). "
"Stranica je prilagođena veganima i vegetarijancima. Trenutno je dostupan na "
"%(languages_num)s jezika."

#: .\templates\about\about.html:19
msgid ""
"The founders of Speedy Net are vegan, support animal rights and object to "
"experiments on animals. Speedy Net is a social network friendly for vegan "
"and vegetarian people and animals."
msgstr ""
"Osnivači Speedy Neta su vegani, podržavaju prava životinja i protive se "
"eksperimentima na životinjama. Speedy Net je društvena mreža prilagođena "
"veganima i vegetarijancima i životinjama."

#: .\templates\about\about.html:21
msgid ""
"We decided to limit the number of friends on Speedy Net to 800. We encourage "
"you to add as friends only people you know personally. You can select which "
"details will appear on your profile as public, which details only to friends "
"and which details will be private. Private details will appear only to you."
msgstr ""
"Odlučili smo ograničiti broj prijatelja na Speedy Netu na 800. Potičemo vas "
"da kao prijatelje dodate samo osobe koje osobno poznajete. Možete odabrati "
"koji će se detalji pojaviti na vašem profilu kao javni, koji će biti samo "
"prijateljima, a koji će biti privatni. Privatni detalji će se pojaviti samo "
"vama."

#: .\templates\about\about.html:23 .\templates\main\main_page.html:15
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You can use our new app, <a href=\"https://%(language_code)s.speedymatch.com/"
"\" title=\"Speedy Match\">Speedy Match</a>, to find matching people for "
"dating. Speedy Match is open to singles of all ages."
msgstr ""
"Možete upotrijebiti našu novu aplikaciju, <a href=\"https://"
"%(language_code)s.speedymatch.com/\" title=\"Speedy Match\">Speedy Match</"
"a>, da pronađete odgovarajuće osobe za spojeve. Speedy Match je otvoren za "
"samce svih dobi."

#: .\templates\about\about.html:25
msgid ""
"All the features on Speedy Net and Speedy Match are free of charge. Join "
"Speedy Net today to find friends, it only takes a few minutes. <a href=\"/\" "
"title=\"Join Speedy Net\">Click here</a> to join."
msgstr ""
"Sve značajke na Speedy Netu i Speedy Matchu su besplatne. Pridružite se "
"Speedy Netu danas i pronađite prijatelje, potrebno je samo nekoliko minuta. "
"<a href=\"/\" title=\"Join Speedy Net\">Kliknite ovdje</a> za pridruživanje."

#: .\templates\about\about.html:27
msgid ""
"Speedy Net is a free software & open source project. If you want to help "
"developing and improving Speedy Net, please contact me by email."
msgstr ""
"Speedy Net je besplatni softver i projekt otvorenog koda. Ako želite pomoći "
"u razvoju i poboljšanju Speedy Neta, kontaktirajte me putem e-pošte."

#: .\templates\about\about.html:29
msgid ""
"Speedy Net is named after <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/speedy.the."
"female.dog\" title=\"Speedy\">Speedy</a>, a female dog that was with us for "
"many years and died in 2003. Speedy gave birth to 7 puppies in 1988."
msgstr ""
"Speedy Net je dobio ime po <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/Speedy.the."
"female.dog\" title=\"Speedy\">Speedy</a>, ženki psa koja je bila s nama "
"mnogo godina i uginula 2003. Speedy je okotila 7 štenaca 1988."

#: .\templates\about\about.html:31
msgid "Speedy Net is currently in alpha. It was launched in June 2012."
msgstr "Speedy Net je trenutno u alfa verziji. Lansiran je u lipnju 2012."

#: .\templates\about\about.html:33
msgid "Thank you and good luck,"
msgstr "Hvala i sretno,"

#: .\templates\about\about.html:34
msgid "Uri Rodberg"
msgstr "Uri Rodberg"

#: .\templates\about\about.html:35
msgid "Founder and director of Speedy Net and Speedy Match,"
msgstr "Osnivač i direktor tvrtki Speedy Net i Speedy Match,"

#: .\templates\about\about.html:36
msgid "Speedy Paz Technologies Ltd."
msgstr "Speedy Paz Technologies Ltd."

